### Describe the feature you'd like to request

We have this type:

```ts
export type Overwrite<TType, TWith> = Omit<TType, keyof TWith> & TWith;
```

Typescript has these defs for Omit:
```
type Omit<T, K extends keyof any> = Pick<T, Exclude<keyof T, K>>;

type Pick<T, K extends keyof T> = {
    [P in K]: T[P];
};

type Exclude<T, U> = T extends U ? never : T;
```

Every single mapped type has a fixed cost to the language server and compiler, each layer is essentially 1 full iteration through the type after all. This utility can be achieved with a single mapped type and no typescript utilities, improving performance by 2-3x



### Describe the solution you'd like to see

